WEBVTT

00:00:01.521 --> 00:00:04.368
Open Numbers and click Add number

00:00:04.368 --> 00:00:07.528
Select SIP in the provider list

00:00:07.528 --> 00:00:10.909
Click the gear to open Configure SIP Trunks

00:00:10.909 --> 00:00:13.688
Click Add

00:00:13.688 --> 00:00:21.521
Name the trunk and set Direction to Both

00:00:21.521 --> 00:00:27.392
Add the IPs or CIDRs your INVITEs come from

00:00:27.392 --> 00:00:36.321
Set the outbound target, tech prefix and strip digits

00:00:36.321 --> 00:00:41.566
Choose the transport

00:00:41.566 --> 00:00:59.474
Turn on Authentication and enter the credentials

00:00:59.474 --> 00:01:02.709
Click Save

00:01:02.709 --> 00:01:05.697
The trunk is listed; edit or delete it from here

00:01:05.697 --> 00:01:16.811
Close the panel: Add custom takes the trunk's numbers
